'' RUN: twenty-two overload picks -- calls by width, sign, float, string, pointer, default and
'' UDT conversion; global and member binary operators; a unary one -- each the one fbc-modern
'' 1.20 picks (measured 2026-10-24). The regression set the one ranker is gated by (LATER-PLAN
'' D step 3, review SEM-08): any changed pick is a bug.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/overload-picks.bas -o tests/codegen/overloadpicks.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/overloadpicks.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/overloadpicks.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 01 f byte
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 02 f short
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 03 f long
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 04 f longint
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 05 f single
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 06 f double
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 07 f string
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 08 f any ptr
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 09 f byte
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 10 f double
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 11 f string
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 12 g int, int
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 13 g int, int
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 14 h ulong
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 15 h longint
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 16 k string
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 17 m zstring ptr
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 18 m integer ptr
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 19 V+V
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 20 V+int
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 21 -V
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 22 V+=V
